cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "Myeloid Cell Atlas across Human Cancers"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a pan-cancer myeloid / macrophage single-cell atlas
  spanning ESCC, PC, AML, NSCLC and TNBC cohorts, including subclustering,
  cell-cell communication, trajectory, co-expression networks, NMF
  meta-programs and signature-based prediction.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Guosheng
    alias: GoulsonWang
    website: "https://github.com/GoulsonWang"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GoulsonWang/Myeloid_Cell_Atlas"
license: MIT
